Ladybird for Debian - unofficial build
======================================

This package is made by VitexSoftware <info@vitexsoftware.cz>. It is not an
official release of the Ladybird Browser Initiative. Please report packaging
problems at https://github.com/Vitexus/ladybird, not upstream. Ladybird is a
trademark of Ladybird Browser Initiative.

The browser lives in /opt/ladybird. Differences from official builds: the
built-in update check is off (update through apt) and Qt is bundled, because
Debian trixie ships an older Qt than Ladybird needs.

The source code of the bundled LGPL libraries is archived as
third-party-sources.tar with each Jenkins build.
